  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi></math> are roots of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2023</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2024</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2023</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2024</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2023</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2024</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2023</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2024</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2023</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2024</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2023</mn><msup><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2024</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></math></p><p>Putting, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></math></p>",
